The published data is derived from the third-party sources below. Their terms
apply to the data they provide; check each source before reusing the data.

OpenF1 (https://openf1.org, https://api.openf1.org/v1/)
  Session data: meetings, sessions, drivers, results, laps, stints, pit stops,
  intervals, positions, race control, weather, overtakes, team radio links.

Jolpica F1 (https://github.com/jolpica/jolpica-f1, https://api.jolpi.ca/ergast/f1/)
  Ergast-compatible API: schedule, round numbers, results, qualifying, sprint
  results, driver and constructor standings.

F1DB (https://github.com/f1db/f1db)
  Career totals. F1DB is licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
  International License (CC BY 4.0, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).
  Data is used as published, aggregated into per-driver career totals.

MultiViewer (https://multiviewer.app)
  Circuit outlines, corners and rotation via api.multiviewer.app, linked from
  OpenF1 meeting data.

Team radio: only links to recordings hosted by Formula 1 are stored; no audio is
re-hosted.

